# Which helper workers each account's coordinator may use, and where its usage is recorded.
# workers: qwen (optional local OpenCode model, shared by all accounts and queued at the
#          gateway; leave it out where the machine lacks the memory, as for personal below),
#          codex (that profile's codex-home), gemini (agy; one Google login per machine, so give it
#          to that login's account only), litellm (budget-checked reviewer; see crew/local.env).
# ledger: usage ledger folder name under CREW_USAGE_ROOT.
# profile	workers	ledger
acme	qwen,codex	acme
globex	qwen,gemini,codex,litellm	globex
personal	codex	personal
